      "content": "so if we're talking about \"anchoring\" and \"meta-words\" being used systematically, it starts to look less like simple marketing and more like a standardized protocol for social conditioning. if an organization or a group wanted to use this to essentially program a level of compliance into the general public via mass media, how would they go about embedding those triggers so they're ubiquitous but wouldn't be recognized as manipulative by the average person?",
